1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,792
Someone takes money from you every day
and you never see it

2
00:00:04,792 --> 00:00:07,458
You never see it happen
no alert, no warning

3
00:00:07,458 --> 00:00:11,583
No receipt. No alert. Nothing.
it leaves no trace

4
00:00:11,583 --> 00:00:14,167
And it's completely legal
that's the part nobody explains

5
00:00:14,167 --> 00:00:18,875
It's called inflation
and almost everyone explains it wrong

6
00:00:18,875 --> 00:00:20,375
You got a raise this year
on paper, you earn more

7
00:00:20,375 --> 00:00:22,583
You're still short at month end
every single month

8
00:00:22,583 --> 00:00:25,292
That's not bad budgeting
it's arithmetic

9
00:00:25,292 --> 00:00:27,708
Ten years ago this filled a cart
same note, same value printed

10
00:00:27,708 --> 00:00:30,042
Today it fills half a bag
identical note, half the goods

11
00:00:30,042 --> 00:00:32,417
The note didn't change
it's the same paper

12
00:00:32,417 --> 00:00:35,417
How MANY of them exist did
that's the whole trick

13
00:00:35,417 --> 00:00:39,583
Money isn't printed
it's LENT into existence

14
00:00:39,583 --> 00:00:41,333
A bank approves a loan
one signature

15
00:00:41,333 --> 00:00:43,458
and the money appears
out of nothing

16
00:00:43,458 --> 00:00:45,167
It didn't come from a vault
there was nothing in there

17
00:00:45,167 --> 00:00:47,458
It was typed into a screen
that's the entire act

18
00:00:47,458 --> 00:00:50,250
Every loan creates new money
multiplied across millions

19
00:00:50,250 --> 00:00:53,250
But the world's bread didn't multiply
the goods stayed the same

20
00:00:53,250 --> 00:00:55,583
More money. Same bread.
that's all inflation is

21
00:00:55,583 --> 00:00:57,750
So bread costs more
and your wage doesn't move

22
00:00:57,750 --> 00:00:59,375
Nobody voted for this
no ballot, no debate

23
00:00:59,375 --> 00:01:01,458
Nobody sent you a bill
it doesn't arrive by post

24
00:01:01,458 --> 00:01:02,958
But you paid it
every day, without noticing

25
00:01:02,958 --> 00:01:05,958
This is the tax nobody voted for
and it never stops

26
00:01:05,958 --> 00:01:08,958
The engine behind it is interest
riba

27
00:01:08,958 --> 00:01:13,625
Debt creates money
money loses value

28
00:01:13,625 --> 00:01:17,125
Value the saver never agreed to lose
no consent was ever asked

29
00:01:17,125 --> 00:01:20,125
Which is why sound money mattered
gold and silver

30
00:01:20,125 --> 00:01:22,917
You cannot type gold into existence
no screen can create it

31
00:01:22,917 --> 00:01:25,917
It has to be dug, weighed, earned
real work, real cost

32
00:01:25,917 --> 00:01:28,917
Hold what cannot be diluted
things with real weight

33
00:01:28,917 --> 00:01:31,625
Real assets. Real ownership.
things you actually hold

34
00:01:31,625 --> 00:01:34,833
Not promises that quietly shrink
not paper claims

35
00:01:34,833 --> 00:01:37,833
Your money should hold its weight
literally

36
00:01:37,833 --> 00:01:40,000
Part two: the fix
follow so you don't miss it
